&lt;div class=&quot;Y3BBE&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAEIAhAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location Requirement: Candidates must reside in California, Arizona, Nevada or New Mexico&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;Y3BBE&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAEIAhAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;Y3BBE&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAEIAhAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The Area Sales Director, Southwest leads the regional Enterprise sales strategy to drive new business growth and account expansion across the Southwest region (CA, AZ, NV, NM) of the United States. This People Leader manages a team of both tenured Enterprise and Strategic Account Executives in the region to strengthen the company&#39;s market presence through strategic vision and operational excellence. The mission focuses on achieving annual revenue targets while cultivating executive-level relationships with CISOs and C-suite stakeholders.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;Fsg96&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEIBBAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Execute a regional go-to-market strategy to achieve annual revenue targets through the management of data-driven KPIs, pipeline metrics, and forecasting models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEIBBAB&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Recruit, mentor, and manage a team of enterprise account executives focused on high-value strategic accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEIBBAC&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Manage long-term relationships with C-suite executives and CISOs to secure new business and expand existing enterprise, commercial, and public-sector accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEIBBAD&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Direct regional channel and alliance partner collaborations to accelerate deal cycles and expand market reach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;Fsg96&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEIBhAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;10+ years of enterprise software sales experience, with at least 5 years in a regional sales leadership role within the cybersecurity, SaaS, or cloud technology sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEIBhAB&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Documented track record of exceeding multi-million-dollar annual revenue targets in high-growth territories.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEIBhAC&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Proficiency in analytical pipeline management, territory planning, and data-driven sales forecasting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEIBhAD&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The ability to travel within the Southwest region for customer and partner engagement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;Fsg96&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEICBAB&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Deep technical knowledge of enterprise security architectures, IT operations, or SaaS management solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEICBAC&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Experience leading and managing distributed or remote sales teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-hveid=&quot;CAEICBAD&quot; data-sae=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;T286Pc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Demonstrated experience navigating complex procurement cycles within both Commercial and State &amp;amp; Local Education accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-RR1 #LI-REMOTE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Axonius is committed to fair and equitable compensation packages. A candidate’s salary will be based on qualifications and relevant experience. In addition to a competitive salary, our packages include stock options and attractive benefits.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Annual On Target Earnings&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$415,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$435,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Axonius:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Axonius transforms cyber asset intelligence into actionability. With the Axonius Asset Cloud, customers preemptively tackle high-risk and hard-to-spot threat exposures, misconfigurations, and overspending. The integrated platform brings together data from every system in an organization’s IT infrastructure to optimize mission-critical risk, performance, and cost measures via actionable intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Covering cyber assets, software, SaaS applications, identities, vulnerabilities, infrastructure, and more, Axonius is the one place to go for Security, IT, and GRC teams to continuously drive actionability across the organization. Cited as one of the fastest-growing cybersecurity startups, with accolades from CNBC, Forbes, and Fortune, Axonius supports millions of assets for leading customers across industries and around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Axonius makes it a priority to invest in our people with competitive compensation and benefits, growth opportunities, community-building, and so much more. Learn more about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axonius.com/company/careers#benefits-and-perks&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axonius.com/company/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;benefits at Axonius&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Axonius we support a diverse and inclusive workplace and believe in equal employment opportunity. We welcome people of different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives&amp;nbsp;to apply. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;race, color, ancestry, religion, age, sex, gender identity, national origin, sexual orientation, citizenship, marital status, disability, or Veteran status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Axonius participates in E-Verify. To learn more, please review the &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/sites/default/files/everify/posters/EVerifyParticipationPoster.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;E-Verify Participation Poster (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; and the &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/sites/default/files/everify/posters/IER_RightToWorkPoster%20Eng_Es.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Right to Work Poster (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application to us, you acknowledge that your personal data will be processed in accordance&amp;nbsp;with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axonius.com/global-job-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Job Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-76&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,0&quot;&gt;Axonius is seeking a Director of Product Security in Tel Aviv to safeguard the Axonius platform, multi-tenant cloud architecture, and emerging AI-driven capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2&quot;&gt;. Reporting directly to the Chief Trust and Security Officer, this leader will drive the end-to-end product security roadmap in close alignment with Tel Aviv R&amp;amp;D and Product leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,4&quot;&gt;. The team’s mission centers on establishing an automated, measurable secure SDLC, enforcing vulnerability remediation SLAs, and safeguarding customer trust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,6&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-77&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Define and execute the end-to-end product security strategy and secure SDLC, measuring maturity against OWASP SAMM or NIST SSDF benchmarks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-78&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Direct automated CI/CD security tooling (SAST, SCA, secrets, IaC, container scanning) alongside risk-based manual secure code review gates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-79&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Own the vulnerability management lifecycle, including triage, fix verification, PSIRT advisory issuance, and paid bug bounty operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-80&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Establish threat modeling and architectural guardrails for AWS cloud workloads and AI/LLM platform capabilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-81&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,0&quot;&gt;12+ years of combined software engineering and security experience, including at least 4 years managing product or application security teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-82&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Documented track record implementing a measurable secure SDLC across engineering teams exceeding 100 developers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-83&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Hands-on proficiency performing secure code reviews in modern languages (Python, Go, JavaScript/TypeScript, or Java) and assessing AWS/Kubernetes architectures&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-84&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,0&quot;&gt;End-to-end operational experience running enterprise SaaS vulnerability management and public or private bug bounty programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;5,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-85&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,0&quot;&gt;Practical experience establishing security governance for LLM applications and agentic workflows (e.g., OWASP Top 10 for LLMs, prompt injection mitigation)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-86&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,0&quot;&gt;Track record of building or embedding AI-assisted automation into security triage or developer review cycles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-87&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Prior leadership experience inside high-growth B2B SaaS or cybersecurity vendors subject to rigorous customer security scrutiny&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-88&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,0&quot;&gt;Public industry contributions, including conference presentations, published CVEs, or security research advisories&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,3,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-89&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience aligning product architecture with SOC 2, ISO 27001, or FedRAMP compliance frameworks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,4,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p id=&quot;p-rc_81e00015caf00f1e-90&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,0&quot;&gt;Industry certifications such as CSSLP, OSWE, or OSCP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;7,5,0,2&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;#LI-AZ1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Axonius:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Axonius transforms cyber asset intelligence into actionability. With the Axonius Asset Cloud, customers preemptively tackle high-risk and hard-to-spot threat exposures, misconfigurations, and overspending. The integrated platform brings together data from every system in an organization’s IT infrastructure to optimize mission-critical risk, performance, and cost measures via actionable intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Covering cyber assets, software, SaaS applications, identities, vulnerabilities, infrastructure, and more, Axonius is the one place to go for Security, IT, and GRC teams to continuously drive actionability across the organization. Cited as one of the fastest-growing cybersecurity startups, with accolades from CNBC, Forbes, and Fortune, Axonius supports millions of assets for leading customers across industries and around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Axonius makes it a priority to invest in our people with competitive compensation and benefits, growth opportunities, community-building, and so much more. Learn more about&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.axonius.com/company/careers#benefits-and-perks&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.axonius.com/company/careers&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;benefits at Axonius&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Axonius we support a diverse and inclusive workplace and believe in equal employment opportunity. We welcome people of different backgrounds, experiences, abilities and perspectives&amp;nbsp;to apply. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;race, color, ancestry, religion, age, sex, gender identity, national origin, sexual orientation, citizenship, marital status, disability, or Veteran status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: small; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; word-spacing: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Axonius participates in E-Verify. To learn more, please review the &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/sites/default/files/everify/posters/EVerifyParticipationPoster.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;E-Verify Participation Poster (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; and the &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.e-verify.gov/sites/default/files/everify/posters/IER_RightToWorkPoster%20Eng_Es.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Right to Work Poster (PDF)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;By submitting your application to us, you acknowledge that your personal data will be processed in accordance&amp;nbsp;with our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.axonius.com/global-job-candidate-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Global Job Candidate Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Axonius is at a pivotal moment. Our platform is a powerhouse of data and technology, and we&#39;re ready to move from being &quot;tech-centric&quot; to &quot;user-centric.&quot; As the Director of Product Design, you aren&#39;t here to tweak a few buttons—you&#39;re here to transform an entire experience across a complex, multi-product platform.&lt;br&gt;You will build and lead a full design department, owning the end-to-end user experience across all Axonius products. You&#39;ll be the connective tissue between product lines—synthesizing a coherent, intuitive experience from a sophisticated set of capabilities. And you&#39;ll be the person who defines what great UX looks like in the AI era: not just adapting to AI features, but rethinking how users interact with intelligence-first products.&lt;br&gt;Beyond the craft, you&#39;ll drive real operational change. You&#39;ll lead the adoption of AI-powered workflows—not just within the design team, but in close partnership with Engineering—finding ways to compress cycles, ship faster, and create outsized impact. You&#39;ll work directly with customers, field teams, PMs, and developers, and you&#39;ll lead cross-functional processes that connect design to the business.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; Team Building:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;4+ years leading a design team&lt;/strong&gt;; experience building and scaling a full design department, not just managing individuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform-Scale Thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to own the UX of a complex, multi-product platform end-to-end—connecting dots across product lines and creating a coherent whole.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SaaS Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Significant experience designing and shipping &lt;strong&gt;B2B SaaS products&lt;/strong&gt; at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Overhaul Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated success transforming a technical, complex product into an intuitive, high-end user experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to advocate for design-led thinking at the executive level while collaborating effectively with Engineering, Sales, and field teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People Development:&lt;/strong&gt; A track record of mentoring designers and managing career growth, not just task delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Era UX:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience designing for AI-powered products or defining UX patterns for intelligence-first experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Workflow Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience driving AI adoption in design and development workflows—reducing cycle times, accelerating delivery, and enabling teams to do more with less.&lt;/li&gt;
