&lt;p&gt;Axonius is hiring a Senior Director, Global Revenue Enablement to lead the global revenue enablement function, driving onboarding, continuous development and effectiveness across Sales, Sales Engineering&amp;nbsp; and Technical Account Management..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute the global revenue enablement strategy, including onboarding, learning &amp;amp; development programs, sales methodology, playbooks and enablement content aligned with GTM priorities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimize role-based onboarding to accelerate time to productivity and ensure new hires have the knowledge, skills and tools to succeed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and deliver ongoing training and certification to strengthen commercial and technical capabilities, and drive consistent field performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leadership to drive consistent adoption of sales methodology and qualification frameworks though training, coaching and reinforcement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Product Marketing, Sales Engineering and Technical Account Managers&amp;nbsp; to ensure field teams are trained on new products, technical capabilities and competitive positioning.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track enablement success metrics: onboarding ramp time, training completion, certification, and skills adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and develop the global enablement team, ensuring high quality execution and alignment with business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Regional Sales and Technical Leadership to identify capability gaps and align enablement priorities to business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with GTM leadership and Product Marketing to launch strategic sales plays, equipping field teams with messaging, training and tools to execute effectively.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales and Technical leadership to equip FLMs with coaching tools, training and frameworks that reinforce skills and drive consistent execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years in revenue enablement or sales enablement, including 5+ years leading teams in B2B Enterprise Software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and scaling enablement programs across global distributed sales and technical teams .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing and driving adoption of a formal sales methodology with measurable improvement on sales execution, pipeline quality and&amp;nbsp; win rates.Strong experience developing training for both sales and technical teams, including product and technical knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence and collaborate with leaders across Sales, Sales Engineering, Technical Account Management, Product and Product Marketing to align programs to business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with experience defining and tracking enablement measurement to pace effectiveness and drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and facilitation skills, with the ability to deliver impactful learning experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a quota-carrying role or sales leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting complex, technical sales environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in the cyber security industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with MEDDPICC, or similar qualification methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
