&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Exposures product team is looking for a Senior Product Manager to lead complex, advanced, AI-heavy cybersecurity features across multiple disciplines from rollout to iterative learning loops. You will manage strategic initiatives, dive into technical details, and drive the strategy for Axonius&#39;s fastest-growing emerging product line, including a dedicated focus on building robust product compliance capabilities. In this role, you will collaborate with global engineering, cyber research, sales, and marketing teams to scale enterprise software solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the product vision, build and maintain the product roadmap, and drive full-lifecycle execution for advanced, AI-heavy enterprise cyber features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end strategy, design, and product implementation for customer compliance modules (including frameworks such as ISO, SOC2, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with enterprise customers to identify business needs, translate them into technical roadmap priorities, and optimize the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with Engineering, Cyber Research, Sales, and Marketing teams to deliver scalable software products to the global market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a Product Manager in a B2B software environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven professional background in Cybersecurity or Networking with demonstrated Domain Knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience owning and executing compliance-focused product initiatives and framework integrations (e.g., ISO, SOC2) within previously delivered products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience managing, designing, or implementing AI-heavy components or machine learning features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full professional proficiency in English with a documented track record of presenting complex product strategies to technical and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience deploying software products to market at enterprise scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience managing Platform Products or building enterprise Asset Management and Data products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background in software engineering, system architecture, or computer science.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated history of navigating complex, multi-variable customer risk and governance environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating closely with dedicated cyber research and threat intelligence teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
