&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,0,0&quot;&gt;Autonomously lead the post-sale technical relationship for accounts across UK, DACH, and emerging regions, providing guidance on platform design, REST API integrations, and Query Wizard data modeling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,1,0&quot;&gt;Build and execute complex automated enforcement workflows and custom scripts to solve operational pain points, such as automated ticketing and shadow cloud discovery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,2,0&quot;&gt;Conduct regular technical reviews and data correlation assessments (EDR, Vulnerability, IAM, Network) to demonstrate quantifiable ROI to director-level stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;3,3,0&quot;&gt;Proactively track operational deployment health, identify technical implementation blockers or leadership risks, and deploy remediation plans to ensure customer retention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
